# UFO-MAP environment variables
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (also at the repo root) and fill in real values.
# The `.env` file is git-ignored and will never be committed. Do NOT put real
# secrets in this file (.env.example).
#
# The Python scripts in UFO-MAP/ load this file automatically at startup via
# the loader in UFO-MAP/constants.py — you do not need to `export` anything.

# ── Anthropic API key ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required only if you want Claude-powered location extraction in
# fetch_data.py. The pipeline runs fine without it; it just falls back to
# regex-based location parsing.
#
# Get a key: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ── Mapbox public token ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required for the 3D globe view in the generated index.html. Without it the
# globe button is silently disabled but the 2D Leaflet map still works.
#
# Get a token: https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/
# IMPORTANT: in the Mapbox dashboard, restrict the token to URLs you control
# (e.g. http://localhost:* and your deployed domain) so a leak is harmless.
MAPBOX_TOKEN=
